SUMMARY:Due 23:59: COMP 208: Assignment 2: loops\, strings and lists
DESCRIPTION:Time: 23:59\n\nPosted Oct 11. Use only material from lectures 1
  to 10 (up to and including lists); anything beyond can cost up to 50%. La
 te: minus 10 of 100 points per day\, one minute late counts as a full day\
 , nothing accepted after 4 days. Submit on Ed Lessons; only your last subm
 ission counts\, and a SyntaxError in it means 0.\n\nWorth 5% of the course
  grade.\n\nSource: A2 PDF on myCourses\, p.2
END:VEVENT
